cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "mcp-taiwan-legal-db: Taiwan Legal Database MCP Server"
message: "If you use this dataset in research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: LawChat
    email: opensource@lawchat.com.tw
    website: https://lawchat.com.tw
repository-code: https://github.com/lawchat-oss/mcp-taiwan-legal-db
abstract: >-
  MCP server for Taiwan legal data: judicial judgments with appeal history,
  national regulations (11,700+ statutes, official English translations,
  amendment dates), 871 Constitutional Court rulings with full reasoning
  text, citation graph and case-file materials, administrative
  interpretations and examination guidelines from about 30 official
  systems, Supreme Court resolutions, legal Q&A conferences, precedents and
  curated judgments, administrative appeal and quasi-judicial decisions,
  legislative reasons, bills and gazette records, local regulations,
  treaties and exchange rules, official statistics, sentencing statistics,
  and open-access legal scholarship.
keywords:
  - taiwan
  - legal data
  - constitutional law
  - judicial yuan
  - citation graph
  - mcp
  - traditional chinese
  - open data
license: CC0-1.0
version: 1.5.0
date-released: "2026-10-03"
